cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, and cite
  the method papers listed under `references`.
title: "DeconvGMM: Gaussian-mixture density deconvolution in JAX (XD and convMMD)"
abstract: >-
  DeconvGMM is a differentiable, JAX-native package for Gaussian-mixture density
  deconvolution and empirical-Bayes denoising under known, heterogeneous
  measurement noise. It offers two co-equal estimators behind a shared API: exact
  Extreme Deconvolution (XD, expectation-maximization) and convolutional Maximum
  Mean Discrepancy (convMMD, a likelihood-free / simulation-based objective).
type: software
